        <mxCell id="c248" value="&lt;i&gt;Column B (PromotionCode) is hidden, and rows 1 and 2, which hold the title, are scrolled out of view. The data bars in DiscountAmount start at zero and the longest is on promotion 8, outlined with its share of the discount dollars. The test counts are zero, which shows that every line carries its promotion&#x27;s rate, not that it was billed inside the promotion&#x27;s dates.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="778" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
